WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.040
Dear Master, how are you?

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.340
This is Sekai.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.260
Are you still training in Guiana?

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.540
I'm living with my sister now, and I've started going to school.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.880
I was disappointed the school has no martial arts clubs.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.560
But I found something interesting.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:28.670
Do you know about Gunpla Battle?

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.130
You use Gundam plastic models to compete in battles.

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:37.920
It's not just a battle of toys.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:41.050
The Gunpla moves like your own arms and legs.

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:45.800
People said martial arts can be dangerous, and they're sometimes banned.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:49.850
But this way, I can really fight in earnest.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:01:02.680
Master, Through Gunpla Battle, I... I'll master the Jigen Haoh school of kenpo you tought me!

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:38.350
Sekai, do you have everything?

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:39.880
Yeah, no problem.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.180
How about your lunch box?

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:42.920
I have it with me.

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:44.280
Good morning.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.190
Hoshino?

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:48.460
Did you come to pick him up?

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:51.980
Um, no. Actually, he's going to...

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:58.440
Sekai, I came to pick you up.

00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:59.390
What?

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:01.280
And you are...

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:06.170
I'm Kousaka. Sekai's classmate, Kousaka Yuuma.

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:08.940
We promised to go to school together, so...

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.880
Hey! When did I promise to--

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.800
We promised yesterday.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:14.730
Did you forget already?

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:18.130
Then let's all go to school together.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:19.690
Yes!

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:32.560
I get it. You came for my sister, didn't you?

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:34.510
Why else would i?

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.860
I thought you came to beg me to let you into the Battle Club.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.070
I don't need your permission.

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:44.200
Fumi... I mean, Hoshino decideds that.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:46.960
I'd welcome you any time.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.660
Thank you.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.830
But there's one problem.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.070
President Miyaga, right?

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:54.000
Yeah.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.950
I don't know if he'll let me transfer to the Battle Club.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.340
No problem at all. Leave it to me!

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.340
<b>No problem at all. Leave it to me!</b>

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:06.180
Excuse the interruption!

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:08.570
How may I help you?

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:10.700
You know why we're here.

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:15.230
President Miyaga! Please allow Kousaka Yuuma to transfer to the Battle Club.

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:18.860
We'd like to enter the Gunpla Battle Championship with him.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.530
Even if you refuse, I'll force you to--

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.080
<b>I don't mind.</b>

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:22.530
So easily?

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:27.420
Clubs must respect their members' own choices.

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:33.230
If Kousaka wishes to transfer to the Battle Club, then I have nothing to say.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.680
Isn't that right, Eri?

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:38.090
Just as you say, President.

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:39.450
Wh-Who's this?

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.510
I didn't know there was such a hottie in the Plamo Club.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:44.810
N-No way!

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:48.990
Y-You're...

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.390
You're the vice president!?

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:52.860
Correct!

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:58.520
Anyway, Kousaka, feel free to go the the Battle Club or anywhere you wish.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:03.450
Even without you, while I'm president, the Plamo Club has nothing to worry about.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.440
Right, Eri?

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.660
Whatever you say, President!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:08.910
Thank you for your time!

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:12.800
Eri, what kind of model should we build next?

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:15.880
How about an MS Girl, President?

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:18.540
That's a great idea!

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.830
Anyway, putting it in Gundam terms.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:26.040
I'd say this situation works for me.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.560
So there're finally 3 members.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.030
All right then.

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:40.200
I'll enter you guys into the Gunpla Battle Championships.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.190
We're counting on you.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.990
I'm happy for you, Hoshino.

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:46.400
Yes, Thank you!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.110
Mr Ral,

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:51.470
I don't really know much about Gunpla Battle,

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:54.830
so please coach the members for me.

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:56.540
Certainly.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.670
Please tell the principal that I, Ral, will carry out my mission

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:03.000
even if it's with my bare hands.

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:05.870
Y-You just have to do it normally.

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:09.960
Hoshino, let's go and practice in the club room.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:11.020
Yeah!

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:15.740
Hoshino.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:17.730
Whats the matter?

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.350
Let me make a real apology for once.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:26.810
I'm sorry that I broke my promise to you,

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:31.030
and grew apart from Gunpla Battle.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.240
The reason I became like that...

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:37.050
It's because of a battle that I played two years ago.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.180
That time, I...

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:40.860
I was...

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:45.240
If you don't want to say it, you don't have to.

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:52.520
I'm happy you came back, and Sekai joined the club.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:56.890
We formed a team of three, and can enter the championship.

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:02.230
I'm satisfied with just that.

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:04.570
Yes.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:09.340
Actually, I've already decided the name of our team.

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:10.680
What is it?

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:12.750
Team...

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.660
Try Fighters!

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:24.000
Let's see the abilities of team Try Fighters.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:26.600
Fumina Hoshino, here I go!

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:29.930
Mock battle model, deployed.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:37.530
Quite a move when the opponent is set at difficulty level A.

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:40.620
The quality of the model, and the control of technique...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:45.290
Her Powered GM Cardigan has high stability.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:50.780
Just as I'd expected from the Battle Club's president.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:59.160
And this is Yuuma's Lightning Gundam.

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:04.910
I guess that Artistic Gunpla Grand Prix he won, wasn't just for show.

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:06.510
I need to improve.

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:10.590
To advance in the championship, I must keep tuning this machine.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:12.720
On the other hand...

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.100
Sekai, try to aim more.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:21.770
I am! Darn, Why won't it hit the mark?

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:22.940
Because you're bad.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.270
Shut up, Yuuma!

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.440
Aim well...

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.220
Enough already!

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.190
I have this!

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:39.150
The Jigen Haoh style of kenpo!

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:46.380
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.440
How's that?

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.340
But this was shooting training.

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:51.950
I thought you were a brainless microbe,

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:54.350
but you're not even mitochondria.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:56.250
Are you saying I'm an idiot?

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:59.350
No. I've concluded that you're an idiot.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:02.270
The Build Burning Gundam is crying.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.240
Build Burning Gundam?

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:08.110
That's the name of your Gunpla.

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:10.330
Don't you know a simple thing like that?

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.150
I don't know how you got it, but...

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:20.240
It's an improve version of the machine. that Mr. Sei used in the 11th World Tournament.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.550
That Gunpla has world-level potential.

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.030
But in the hands of this idiot--

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.360
Stop calling me that!

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:30.280
Enough with the quarreling.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:35.210
I saw your abilities in that mock battle.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.600
Now it's time for a real fight.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:42.390
My own Gouf R-35 will be your opponent.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:44.940
The Gouf R-35.

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:49.580
The Gunpla of Mr. Ral, known as the Blue Giant.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.100
Wonderful.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:54.960
I get that Gouf is the name of the robot,

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:57.280
but what does R-35 stand for?

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:01.480
It's stand for Ral, 35 years old.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.950
35 years old!?

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:06.440
Is there a problem?

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:07.680
N-No...

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:09.600
I think it's great.

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:13.600
Then, let's fight a real Gunpla Battle.

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:15.770
Hi, you've started already?

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.280
Sir!

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:21.000
I wanted to help somehow, so I went ahead on my own

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:24.890
and booked you a practice match.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.640
A pratice match!?

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:27.810
That's great!

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:31.480
But what about my Gouf...?

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.680
Thank you very much!

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:36.940
That's the only thing I could do.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.150
Oh, that's plenty

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:43.580
In the middle of a practice, everyone forgot about Ral...

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:46.250
So who'll be our opponent?

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:49.420
The Plastic Model Club from the St. Odessa Girl's School.

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:50.190
What!?

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:52.590
St. Odessa Girls' School.

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:54.430
A school for girls?

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:57.760
Don't look down on them because they're girls, Sekai.

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:03.710
Last year, they made the best 4 in the West Tokyo regional qualifiers.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:11.370
What's more, last year, Seiho's Battle Club was knocked out by St. Odessa in the first round.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:15.840
To tell you the truth. it's gonna be tough.

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:20.800
A charming sound...

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:42.220
Mirai, thanks for taking on this shoot on short notice.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:43.930
It's all right.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:47.100
This is a Gunpla, right?

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:51.440
There are more and more women building Gunpla these days,

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:53.650
so we dediced to feature them in our magazine.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.810
Do you like Gunpla, Mirai?

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.940
Not exactly.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:00.690
But my brother's started playing Gunpla Battle.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.910
He seems really happy.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.790
The Gunpla Battle Club is playing a practice match!

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:09.620
With which school?

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.620
St. Odessa Girls' School.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:15.130
That school famous for being full of cute girls?

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:16.630
Hey, let's go!

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:17.500
Right.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.840
Oh, boys...

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:23.680
By the way, Kousaka from our school is playing.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.010
Really?

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:25.890
Let's go watch!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:32.520
It's about time.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:33.730
I think they're here.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:58.590
Long time no see, Miss Fumina.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.960
Yeah, Gyanko.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.050
Gyanko?

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.840
Her real name is Kaoruko Sazaki.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:09.470
But ever since elementary school, she's been using Zeon's Gyan type mobile suits.

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.560
So her nickname is "Gyanko".

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:15.480
Thank you for the detailed explanation, Miss Fumina.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:19.230
But isn't there something else you should say first?

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:22.690
In response to your desire for a practice match,

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.650
we came all the way here.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.660
Th... ...u.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.580
Eh? I can't hear you.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.330
THANKS!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.160
Well said.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:39.710
I thought you were the Battle Club's only member this year.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:44.380
Well, I guess they're ragtag members you found on the street.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.890
Miss Kaoruko! he's wearing glasses. How cute.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:53.020
The other boy looks pretty wild. Too fascinating to wait!

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:56.100
You're Kousaka Yuuma, right?

00:13:56.890 --> 00:14:00.400
The winner of the Grand Prix in the Artistic Gunpla Contest.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.730
Fortunately.

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:07.530
However... victory in Gunpla Battle isn't decided only by model-building skills!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.700
I'll remember that.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.830
Don't forget about me.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.990
No, please forget about him.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.200
What do you mean!?

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:18.500
I don't count you as part of our fighting strength.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.830
What!?

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.460
You two, stop!

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:26.510
Miss Kaoruko, the cute boys are flirting.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:27.880
This is fascinating.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:32.140
They don't have a hundredth of my big brother Susumu's charisma.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:36.060
Now, let's start Gunpla Battle!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.600
<i>Gunpla Battle, combat mode, start up.</i>

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.060
<i>Model damage level, set to B.</i>

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.110
<i>Please set your GP base.</i>

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.820
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.330
<i>Field 3, Forest.</i>

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:57.120
<i>Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.630
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:06.340
Hoshino Fumina, Powered GM Cardigan.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.760
Kousaka Yuuma, Lightning Gundam.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:13.050
Kamiki Sekai, Build Burning Gundam.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.470
Team Try Fighters!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.890
Let's go!

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.240
Gyanko's not using a Gyan!?

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.410
It's an R-Jarja.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.960
A machine the Neo Zeon forces created based on the Gyan's concept.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:45.090
Fussy about the details, she really is Sazaki's sister.

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:48.550
Yes. I named it R-Gyaga!

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:55.640
Miss Fumina, just like last year, team Song Dynasty Vase shall triumph!

00:15:56.760 --> 00:16:00.890
I swear that on this shield that big brother Susumu gave me!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.820
Yuu, cover us from the rear.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:10.820
Roger that.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:14.280
Sekai, we're going to pick off the enemy one bye one.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:17.490
Two against one? Isn't that bullying?

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:20.580
It's tactics. A stratagem that's necessary to win.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:21.410
Let's go!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.670
One sniper and two attackers.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.800
Your formation is so typical.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:30.880
Miss Kaoruko!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.390
Nice shot.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.350
He's a Grand Prix winner for sure.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:41.770
Head for the blind spots!

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:42.890
Roger that.

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:44.650
So slow.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.570
Sekai. You're in my way!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.240
Don't go too far ahead, Sekai!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:57.990
One on one? How sporting!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.450
I don't... think so!

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:03.540
There are three robots now!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.370
It's a Jet Stream Attack.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.920
He rushed out unarmed.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.050
You're so stupid, it's almost fascinating!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:15.880
Sekai!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.010
That idiot.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:19.850
He fell for such a classical trick.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:24.310
That's one down.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.690
Now it's your turn, Miss Fumina!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.440
A wave attack.

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:41.080
In real war, a 20% difference in fighting strength decides the battle.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:45.120
Since it's 3 against 2, our victory is assured!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.460
You're finished, Miss Fumina!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.210
No, you!

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:58.550
What?

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.390
Now we're even.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.230
No, we aren't!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.240
Jigen Haoh style!

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.320
<i>Crimson Fist of the Azure Sky: Soten Guren-Ken</i>

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.320
Soten Guren-Ken!

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.040
Miss Mahiru!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.590
How could you...!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:34.710
You never get past the first round!

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.070
There are too many.

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:57.740
I can't dodge them!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:58.700
Don't worry.

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.580
Jigen Haoh style!

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.910
<i>Whirlwind Tornado: Senpu Tatsumaki-Geri</i>

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.910
Senpu Tatsumaki-Geri!

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.710
What is that technique!?

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.110
Jigen Haoh style!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:38.400
<i>Holy Fist Thrust: Seiken-Zuki</i>

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:38.400
Seiken-Zuki!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.170
I-It's being sucked out...

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:57.590
My R-Gyagya!

00:19:57.960 --> 00:19:58.800
Gyanko!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.380
Miss Kaoruko!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.380
<b>Miss Kaoruko!</b>

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:08.270
Wh-Why?

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.890
You love Gunpla, don't you?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.440
And this.

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:18.820
It's a wonderful shield.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:26.620
You... What's your name?

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.290
Sekai. It's Kamiki Sekai.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:32.290
Sekai...

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:34.830
It's my loss.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.380
<i>Concession signal confirmed.</i>

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.720
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.890
Wow, the Battle Club won!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.220
Yuuma!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.220
That was great.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:53.390
I can expect more from them in the qualifiers.

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:55.400
Thanks, Sekai.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:57.150
It was nothing!

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:02.740
If you hadn't recklessly charged ahead, we could've won with my sniping.

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:05.950
You put us at a disadvantage.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.740
But we won anyway.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.200
That was beginner's luck.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.450
It was my ability!

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.870
That's enough! Stop fighting!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:16.250
Miss Kaoruko...

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:17.630
We're sorry...

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:27.140
Sekai... Kamiki Sekai.

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:04.770
I heard you won practice match yesterday.

00:23:04.770 --> 00:23:05.900
Well done.

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:08.280
Oh, it's nothing...

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:09.860
Huh?

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:11.740
Gyanko?

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:13.280
Why is she here?

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:19.080
Good morning, Sekai.

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:20.580
Oh, the girl from--

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:25.420
I made lunch for you. Help yourself.

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:28.340
Really? For me? Thanks!

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:31.590
Bye.

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:35.680
Yeah, thanks!

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:39.640
Yes! I have two lunch boxes. I can eat one before lunch break.

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:42.730
Sekai, do you understand what this means?

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:44.360
Lunch is lunch.

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:46.270
What more meaning is there?

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:49.070
So, you really don't get it.

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:51.110
That's my brother...

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:53.660
Huh?

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:02.830
Sekai, let's go to Gunpla paradise!

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:04.080
Gunpla paradise?

00:24:04.080 --> 00:24:05.590
It's really awesome!

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:06.960
Next Episode, G-Muse.

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:09.450
Trouble and encounters await us there!
